ged to load SW \(U59\)\nAdded PMIC control section \(U58, U56, U57 and passives\)\nRemoved series resistor for SPI and UART HW flow control\nVoltage Monitoring domain and Protection Circuit o/p changed to P6_VDD\nChanged trace data line connection \(to 9.\
3, 7.6, 7.5, 7.4\)\nC22 Cap on VRF changed to 10uF \nRemoved SW8 and connected CINT directly, CMOD connection changed to 7.7\nShield # changed to 13.6/6.3\nAdded additional LED on pin 13.7 and 1.5\nAdded option to change logic for user SW and added pull-u\
p/down\nBack annotated from layout " , "Text Location X-Coordinate=300" , "Text Location Y-Coordinate=150" , "Font=Arial" \);)/S/JavaScript>>/Border[0 0 0]/C[0 1 0]/Rect[7 7 8 8]/Subtype/Link/Type/Annot>>
